WEBVTT

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.990
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.910
"Be strong and sad!"

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.780
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:16.300
Raise your hands!

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:27.180
I'm sure you won't realize it,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.110
But you're the same as you always were.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:35.840
You smiled at me.

00:00:37.270 --> 00:00:41.940
Like a leaf swaying in the wind,

00:00:42.160 --> 00:00:48.790
It seems like my heart is going to explode.

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:53.630
Your heart is shouting,

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:56.580
"Be strong and be sad!"

00:00:57.070 --> 00:01:00.560
Just a little more, just a little bit more.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:04.480
Raise your hands!

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:09.250
Someday, you will be gentle,

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.350
And understand what I am saying to you!

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:16.210
It'll be all right, no matter where you go,

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:20.720
This excitement will never stop!

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.910
Tsumugi
High School

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.910
Culture

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:39.910
Festival

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:38.110
Hey! Bring me some nails!

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:39.820
Do you have any paint?

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:41.660
Sorry! I'll go get it!

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:43.910
Japanese Tea

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:43.910
Ceremony Club Special:

00:01:41.910 --> 00:01:43.910
Grilled Potatoes

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:46.210
Good, good!

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:48.750
It's almost time for the Culture Festival!

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.630
It's getting more exciting every day!

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:53.050
Aren't you done yet?

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:55.550
No. Where should we put our stall?

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:57.630
What about the schedule?

00:01:59.010 --> 00:01:59.720
Amamiya-san.

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:04.430
Someone from the baseball club said that they want to use the drum set.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:08.020
Excuse me, Amamiya-san...

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:12.860
Sakurai-kun.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:15.940
What is it, Amamiya-kun?

00:02:17.780 --> 00:02:20.530
You should be thinking seriously about the Culture Festival!

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.580
We haven't decided what kind of event the administrative team should hold.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.410
What are you going to do about it?

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.750
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:33.960
I've already thought of a big plan that'll surprise everyone!

00:02:34.550 --> 00:02:37.340
Then please shape up and put your proposal in writing.

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:40.470
The Culture Festival starts in a month.

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:56.280
Oh, come to think of it, I haven't received a proposal from Class 2-A.

00:02:56.690 --> 00:02:59.570
Oh, that's because, well...

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:01.860
We're discussing it.

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:03.370
Aoba-kun.

00:03:04.080 --> 00:03:05.330
Are you still discussing it?

00:03:05.830 --> 00:03:06.950
Yes.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:10.040
But... it's all right!

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:12.120
I don't think it'll take much longer.

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:14.840
Everyone's working hard on it!

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:22.970
An Exciting Secret

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.260
Cosplay Maid

00:03:23.010 --> 00:03:24.260
Cafe

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:30.520
So, we have decided to present a Cosplay Maid Cafe for the Culture Festival!

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:31.350
ALL RIGHT!

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.770
Yeah! Right on!

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:35.360
What's your problem?

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.360
Why do we have to dress up as maids?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:40.150
That's sexual discrimination!

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:41.280
I'll never do it!

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:42.660
That's right!

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:44.120
Shape up!

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.450
SILENCE!

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:55.210
You don't understand the meaning of a Cosplay Maid Cafe.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:04:00.420
We'd like you to learn how to deliver traditional Japanese hospitality by being part of a Cosplay Maid Cafe.

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.930
THAT'S SEXUAL DISCRIMINATION!

00:04:03.220 --> 00:04:05.470
Well, I'd like to try dressing up like that.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.930
Don't let them trick you into doing it!

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.020
I'm completely against it.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:14.520
You just want to see Sayuri dressed up as a maid, don't you?

00:04:14.940 --> 00:04:15.770
What?

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:17.610
Don't be ridiculous!

00:04:18.020 --> 00:04:22.650
We just want to do research on maids!

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:24.530
Isn't that right, Doujima?

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:26.200
Yeah!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:35.000
Well, it is true that Amamiya would look attractive dressed up as a maid.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:36.290
WHY'D YOU GO AND SAY THAT?!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:40.670
I knew it!

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.880
Why are they so obsessed with Sayuri?

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.590
I'm cuter than they think!

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:52.480
Geez.

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:54.640
I can never get along with them.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:01.780
I'm sorry. It looks like they still haven't decided what to do.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.740
What'll we do, Amamiya-san?

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:23.720
Eat up Riku!

00:05:24.060 --> 00:05:25.890
Eating time is an important thing!

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:31.060
Excuse me, Amamiya-san!

00:05:31.060 --> 00:05:31.890
Over here!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:33.140
Sorry for the wait!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:34.930
Let's hurry!

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:35.950
What's wrong, Riku?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.670
Could it be that you don't want this bread?!

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:40.580
Such a waste!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:43.940
Hiyoko-kun!

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:45.990
Did you eat EVERYTHING?!

00:05:45.110 --> 00:05:46.880
It's always been this way! Dang!

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.810
What the hell is this?!

00:05:47.360 --> 00:05:48.320
I've got no choice.

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:49.950
I'll go back to class.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.540
Is Amamiya-san here?

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:58.620
Amamiya-san went to the fountain a while ago.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:05:59.960
Oh, Amamiya-san!

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.130
I'm sorry. Did something happen?

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.300
Do you have the event schedule for the gym?

00:06:06.970 --> 00:06:10.090
I redid it a while ago, but it looks pretty full.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:11.850
I'll have to redo it again.

00:06:12.300 --> 00:06:15.810
You have to hurry or lunch will be over, Sayuri.

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:17.480
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:20.770
I've got to finish this before lunch is over.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.900
Is that for the Culture Festival?

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:24.690
Yes.

00:06:25.150 --> 00:06:26.070
That much?

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.740
Isn't that way too much?

00:06:28.070 --> 00:06:28.990
It can't be helped.

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:30.530
It's for the Culture Festival.

00:06:30.870 --> 00:06:33.740
Well, we'll go on ahead.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:34.660
Okay.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.750
We'll be at the usual place.

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:45.920
Amamiya-san.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.920
Wh-What is it, Aoba-kun?

00:06:49.380 --> 00:06:52.720
Oh, I just wanted to help you with some of that.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:57.060
After all, I'm part of the Administrative Committee for the moment.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:00.390
It's all right.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.310
I can do this much.

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:03.520
But...

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:04.900
Hey!

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:05.980
Aoba!

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:07.400
Come here for a sec!

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:09.990
We'll show you something fun!

00:07:11.110 --> 00:07:14.070
Go on. You should eat a proper lunch.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.910
We'll have to work hard after school.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:22.000
We're asking you nicely. Come along now.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.040
Okay!

00:07:24.880 --> 00:07:26.920
Thank you, Aoba-kun.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:28.550
All right, then.

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:30.420
I've got to do my best too.

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:39.930
Hey, isn't she hot?

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:41.640
She's great!

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.940
What's wrong, Riku-kun?

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:50.070
You've GOTTA be interested in this!

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.030
Are you feeling sick?

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:55.160
You aren't your usual self!

00:07:55.660 --> 00:07:57.700
Oh, no, it's just that...

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:01.660
I let Amamiya-san do all that work by herself.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:04.460
That's true.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.420
All we ever do is get in her way.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:13.630
Yes. I want to see Amamiya dressed up as a maid, but I have to think about how she feels too.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:19.260
Oh dear. It seems that you still don't know just how amazing Amamiya-san is.

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.020
What are you saying?

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:23.390
There's a story behind it.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:27.110
The Legend of Amamiya Sayuri

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:27.110
Part 7

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:32.650
Once upon a time, an illness was spreading, and no one knew why.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:35.570
The grass and trees were all dying.

00:08:36.490 --> 00:08:45.040
When Amamiya-san saw that, she helped the Gardening Club improve the soil and helped nurse the plants back to health.

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:56.300
A month later, their hard work paid off, the plants bore fruit, and they had the ultimate garden, free of sickness!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:09:02.430
In other words, Amamiya-san doesn't mind working hard.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:05.520
She's happier when she's busy working.

00:09:08.690 --> 00:09:12.030
But you were talking about a vegetable garden, not a flower garden.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:14.070
Shut up, Riku-kun!

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:16.990
Well, that's true, but we shouldn't complain.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.570
Let's think of another idea.

00:09:18.910 --> 00:09:19.580
Yeah.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:24.540
It's against our policy to bother Amamiya.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:26.670
Everyone!

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:29.710
So, what'll we do?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:32.880
Do you have any ideas, Riku-kun?

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:34.880
Huh?

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.890
Where'd he go off to?

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:42.890
Wasshoi! Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:09:38.470 --> 00:09:42.890
Note: This is a traditional chant used in Japanese festivals, where people carry portable shrines around. In this instance, the "shrine" is Aoba.

00:09:43.180 --> 00:09:45.390
Wasshoi! Wasshoi! Wasshoi!

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.390
Could this mean...

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:53.780
I knew it.

00:09:54.110 --> 00:09:56.360
Are you doing well, Aoba-kun?

00:09:57.070 --> 00:09:58.700
I'm not going to participate in a play.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:00.370
I know that.

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:03.080
I have something else to ask of you today.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.910
Something to ask of me?

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:11.880
I'd like to use Amamiya Sayuri for our next play.

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:12.460
Huh?

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:20.180
Back then, on the day of your audition, I saw a glimpse of her talent.

00:10:20.840 --> 00:10:23.720
Amamiya Sayuri would shine on stage!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:31.020
She would be perfect for the role of the heroine in the Culture Festival.

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.030
Wait a minute, please!

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:37.900
Amamiya-san has work to do for the Administrative Committee.

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:39.660
She doesn't have the time for a play!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:42.160
Was that what she said?

00:10:44.870 --> 00:10:46.750
Was that what she said?

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.960
No she didn't, but...

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:53.040
Then I'd like you to ask her.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.130
Ask her whether or not she'd like to be in our play.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:59.510
But no matter how you look at it, it's impossible!

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.300
We can't give her any more work to do!

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:05.970
You're as stubborn as ever.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:09.310
Sensei, let us take care of this.

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:10.890
Oh, will you?

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.690
Drama Club Technique: Hane no Mai!

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:14.690
Note: "Hane no Mai" means "Feathered Dance."

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:17.320
Are you gonna tickle me again?!

00:11:17.780 --> 00:11:19.490
I won't give in this time!

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:21.490
Note: "Kakeru Ni" means "Mark II."

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:36.000
Drama Club

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.740
Take that!

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:28.870
Why me?!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:33.830
Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.500
I'm Aoba Riku!

00:11:36.920 --> 00:11:39.130
Heya! Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love.

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:40.220
I'm Sakurai Haru!

00:11:48.350 --> 00:11:49.520
Oh dear.

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:52.770
What'll I say to Amamiya-san about the play?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:59.150
Note: Hatsume Souseki is a famous Japanese author.
"Sanshiro" and "From Then On..." are two of his books.

00:11:52.900 --> 00:11:59.230
Hatsume Souseki.
Sanshiro. From Then On

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:57.230
That's all for today.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.240
For now, I should go talk to her.

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:05.410
Amamiya-san!

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.450
We need more security guards!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:08.620
The Mystery Club...

00:12:13.620 --> 00:12:15.790
Sh-She looks pretty busy now...

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.800
I should ask him out once in a while.

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:27.100
Okay.

00:12:27.510 --> 00:12:27.970
Here I go.

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:30.470
E-Excuse me, Aoba-san.

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:32.640
Oh, Mina-chan!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:33.980
What's up?

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:36.230
U-Um...

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:40.230
It's been a while, so I was wondering if you would come watch me practice again.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:41.650
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.650
I'm too busy right now.

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.330
I-I see.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:49.240
I'm sorry.

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:51.040
What are you saying, Aoba?

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:52.580
You're so cold-hearted today!

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:55.170
You usually say "okay" without hesitation!

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:57.250
Quit teasing me!

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:57.790
Honestly, now!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:00.590
Amamiya-san!

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:03.260
Sakurai-san is calling you.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:05.380
Okay. I'll be right there.

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.390
Amamiya-san!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:09.810
Mina-chan!

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:10.850
I'll see you later!

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:15.020
Amamiya-san!

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.980
He must have something else to do.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:24.190
Amamiya-san!

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:25.200
Amamiya-sa-

00:13:27.030 --> 00:13:28.700
Good afternoon, Amamiya-san.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.240
Good afternoon.

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:34.910
That book you lent me the other day was really interesting!

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.250
That's nice. I'm glad you liked it.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:41.090
Hey, I found a great restaurant!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.130
Wanna tag along next time?

00:13:44.760 --> 00:13:45.840
Hey, Amamiya-kun!

00:13:46.130 --> 00:13:47.510
Sorry about this.

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.340
Have you finished your proposal?

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.800
Of course I have!

00:13:50.800 --> 00:13:51.890
I'm very happy with it!

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:54.100
RIIIKU-KUN!

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:56.690
K-Kasuga-san?!

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.690
Oh, I never expected to see you here!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:13:58.810
It's destiny!

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.060
Cut it out!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:00.480
I'm so happy!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:02.070
Wanna go hang out?

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:02.980
Well?

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:06.950
I have to get ready for the Culture Festival today!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:10.120
It's all right once in a while!

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.990
We're lovers, after all!

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:12.450
WHAT?!

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:15.290
Oh, it's Aoba-kun!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:17.000
How nice.

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.790
He's always so cheerful.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:20.250
Now, moving on...

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:24.710
I don't think we can organize all this by ourselves.

00:14:24.710 --> 00:14:27.170
I think we'll have to work together with Class A.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.260
Amamiya-san.

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.090
Amamiya-san!

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.970
Hey! Let me go!

00:14:33.970 --> 00:14:36.890
No way! I'll never let you go!

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.390
Oh, Riku-kun!

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:42.860
O-Oh crap!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:44.690
I'm so sorry!

00:14:45.110 --> 00:14:46.490
I'm busy today!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.450
O-Okay.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:51.910
Excuse me.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:56.330
S-Say, Amamiya-san, I have something to...

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.330
SHUT UP!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:07.920
U-Um...

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:09.420
I...

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:12.970
I'm so sorry!

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:18.640
I don't believe it!

00:15:18.640 --> 00:15:21.100
I've never seen her like that before!

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.150
A-Amamiya-san!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.410
Amamiya-san!

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.780
Where'd she go?

00:15:41.790 --> 00:15:45.350
To face it or turn away from it, is also part of youth, Riku.

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:23.330
Why did I do that?

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.340
Amamiya-san. Where are you?

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:44.660
Are you all right, Aoba-kun?

00:17:49.830 --> 00:17:55.300
No one is as kind as she is. She'd even listen to my problems, but...

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.840
SHUT UP!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:02.930
Why did she do that?

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:45.270
Amamiya-san!

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:47.390
Aoba-kun!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.350
H-How did you know I was here?

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.230
Thank goodness. So you were here after all.

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:57.900
Listen, I wanted to tell you something earlier.

00:18:58.900 --> 00:18:59.490
I'm sorry.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:00.030
What?

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.820
I didn't mean to do that.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:03.950
I...

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.330
I didn't mean to do that either.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:08.250
I thought that something must've been bothering you.

00:19:08.500 --> 00:19:09.580
So I was worried...

00:19:10.170 --> 00:19:12.580
No, it's all my fault.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:17.920
I don't even know why I did something like that.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:19.090
Don't worry.

00:19:19.760 --> 00:19:21.090
Everyone understands.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:23.010
And also...

00:19:25.310 --> 00:19:29.020
Everyone likes that part of you.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.110
Wow, what a lovely view.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:45.080
I never knew that a place like this existed.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:07.930
It's so amazing!

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:09.970
It's so pretty!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:14.150
This is my secret place.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:16.690
Your secret place?

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:17.770
Yes.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.530
I can see the whole school from here.

00:20:22.450 --> 00:20:26.740
And no one ever comes here, so it's a good place to clear my head.

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:28.450
Oh.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:32.500
I love looking at the school from here.

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:35.830
Everyone looks like they're having fun.

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.420
I love this school.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:40.170
That's why...

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:56.270
What's wrong, Aoba-kun?

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:57.980
Your face is red. Do you have a cold?

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:01.320
No, that's not it.

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.530
Well, to be honest...

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:10.290
Kurotokage-sensei asked me to ask you if you wanted to participate in a play for the Culture Festival.

00:21:10.950 --> 00:21:11.910
A play?

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:12.830
Me?

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.460
I guess you can't.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:16.710
It's all right if you can't participate.

00:21:18.460 --> 00:21:20.590
I think I'll give it a try.

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:21.710
What?

00:21:25.970 --> 00:21:26.800
In exchange...

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:33.180
Please keep this place a secret between you and me.

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:35.230
Is that all right?

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:36.940
Yeah.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:47.030
But, will you be all right?

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:48.990
You're on the Administrative Committee too.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:53.620
Yes. I enjoy being busy.

00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:58.080
And besides, it'll be a good opportunity to clear my head.

00:21:59.420 --> 00:22:02.710
Oh, so the legend was true!

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:05.130
What legend?

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:08.220
Oh, it's nothing! Nothing at all!

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:36.540
As the morning sunlight streams through

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:41.710
I immediately start to think of you.

00:22:43.420 --> 00:22:48.130
The moment our eyes first met

00:22:48.680 --> 00:22:53.890
This love began.

00:22:55.220 --> 00:22:59.850
This light illuminates our future

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:06.280
Because you're my destined one.

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:11.780
I start to smile.

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:16.830
This very feeling, I've been searching for it all along.

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:23.960
I have grasped this piece of a miracle which fell into this world.

00:23:24.290 --> 00:23:29.720
I will run to your side, my love!

00:23:30.130 --> 00:23:35.310
The two of us can overcome any obstacle, no matter how high.

00:23:35.600 --> 00:23:42.060
Even though our love is still young, it's my treasure!

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.490
Next Episode Preview

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:53.160
Sensei, have you ever transferred between schools before?

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:57.660
Well, I'm a villain right now, but I used to be a romantic.

00:23:57.660 --> 00:23:59.500
That's not what I meant!

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:00.410
Oh, that?

00:24:00.410 --> 00:24:03.250
Line up, everyone!

00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:04.630
That's not what I meant!

00:24:03.250 --> 00:24:04.630
Note: This is a pun. "Tenkou" can mean "line up" as well as "transfer."

00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:06.420
Take one step forward!

00:24:03.750 --> 00:24:06.710
Keep the bathroom clean!
Cleaning Committee.

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:06.000
It's going to rain this afternoon.

00:24:05.000 --> 00:24:06.840
Note: "Tenkou" can also mean "weather."

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:06.840
That's the weather, not transferring!

00:24:06.840 --> 00:24:08.150
Oh, the lights are shining!

00:24:08.190 --> 00:24:09.000
That's not it either!

00:24:08.250 --> 00:24:09.090
Note: "Tenkou" can also mean "spotlight." The teacher misheard her.

00:24:11.140 --> 00:24:13.610
Next time on Tokimeki Memorial - Only Love:

00:24:15.580 --> 00:24:16.450
Please watch it.

00:24:21.100 --> 00:24:24.000
Sensei, why don't you become a comedian?
